        <div reveal-anim-1="" class="section-eyebrow">
          <div class="section-eyebrow-dot"></div>
          <div>FAQ</div>
        </div>
        <h2 section-title="" class="heading-style-2 section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-image-grid is-card">
        <div reveal-anim-4="" class="faq-contact-card">
          <div class="faq-contact-card-top"><img src="/images/faq-chat-avatar_1faq-chat-avatar.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Portrait of Oliver Ecker, customer success lead" class="faq-contact-card-image">
            <p class="faq-contact-card-title">More Questions? Chat with Oliver Ecker.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact-v3" class="case-card-button is-inverse">Book a Call with Paul</a>
        </div>
        <div faq-list="" class="faq-list">
          <div reveal-anim-1="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">Which industries benefit most from Euphoria’s automation?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Euphoria is built for finance-led teams in SaaS, fintech, agencies and e-commerce. Any business that reconciles bank feeds, sends invoices and reports to investors will see the biggest gains in the first month.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">What is the usual process to get started?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Connect your bank accounts and accounting tool, invite your team, and Euphoria imports the last 12 months of transactions. Most teams are fully set up in under an hour with guided onboarding.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-3="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">How long does a typical implementation take?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Self-serve plans go live the same day. Business and partnership customers usually complete a full rollout, including historical data migration and custom reports, within two to three weeks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-4="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">Do you support companies operating in multiple countries?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Euphoria handles multi-currency ledgers, entity-level reporting and consolidated statements, so a group with subsidiaries in several countries can close every entity from one workspace.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-5="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">Can Euphoria integrate with our existing business systems?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Native integrations cover the most common accounting, payment, payroll and CRM tools, and an open API lets your engineers connect anything else. See the Integrations page for the full list.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-6="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question">What kind of customer support do you offer after launch?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Every plan includes email support and a searchable help centre. Business customers get priority chat and a shared Slack channel with a dedicated finance specialist who knows your setup.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
